          %h3#relation_to_lenses Relation to lenses
          %p
            The observation that
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/lenses+%28in+computer+science%29"} lenses (in computer science)
            are equivalently the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coalgebra+over+a+comonad"} coalgebras
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/costate+comonad"} costate comonad
            (cf.
            = succeed ")" do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monads+in+computer+science"} monads in computer science
          %ul
            %li{:id => "O’Connor10"}
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Russell+O%E2%80%99Connor"}> Russell O’Connor
                ,
                %em Lenses Are Exactly the Coalgebras for the Store Comonad
                (30th Nov 2010) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://r6research.livejournal.com/23705.html"}> r6research:23705
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li{:id => "O’Connor11"}
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Russell+O%27Connor"}> Russell O'Connor
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Functor is to Lens as Applicative is to Biplate: Introducing Multiplate
                %a{:href => "https://dl.acm.org/doi/proceedings/10.1145/2036918"} ICFP ‘11: ACM SIGPLAN International Conference on Functional Programming
                (2011) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1103.2841"}> arXiv:1103.2841
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p Early review:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jeremy+Gibbons"}> Jeremy Gibbons
              ,
              %em
                %a{:href => "https://patternsinfp.wordpress.com/2011/01/31/lenses-are-the-coalgebras-for-the-costate-comonad/"} Lenses are the coalgebras for the costate comonad
              (2011)
          %p Further details:
          %ul
            %li#GibbonsJohnson12
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jeremy+Gibbons"}> Jeremy Gibbons
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Johnson"} Michael Johnson
              = succeed "," do
                %em Relating Algebraic and Coalgebraic Descriptions of Lenses
              %strong 49
              (2012) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.14279/tuj.eceasst.49.726"}> doi:10.14279/tuj.eceasst.49.726
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.cs.ox.ac.uk/jeremy.gibbons/publications/colens.pdf"} pdf
          %p Further review:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bartosz+Milewski"}> Bartosz Milewski
                ,
                %em
                  %a{:href => "https://bartoszmilewski.com/2013/10/08/lenses-stores-and-yoneda/"} Lenses, Stores, and Yoneda
                (2013)
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bartosz+Milewski"}> Bartosz Milewski
                , pp 240 in:
                %em The Dao of Functional Programming
                (2023) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://github.com/BartoszMilewski/Publications/blob/master/TheDaoOfFP/DaoFP.pdf"}> pdf
                ,
